sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: x402 failure: a used authorization is sent again (replayed nonce)
  accDescr: Sequence diagram: x402 failure: a used authorization is sent again (replayed nonce). 4 participants: Client (agent), Resource server, Facilitator, and Base Sepolia. 6 steps, 2 crossing a trust boundary. Based on x402 v2.0 (2025-12-09). Step 1: Client (agent) to Resource server: Retry with PAYMENT-SIGNATURE. Step 2: Resource server to Facilitator: POST /verify. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 3: Facilitator to Base Sepolia: Read authorizationState(from, nonce). This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 4: Base Sepolia to Facilitator: Return true (nonce used). Step 5: Facilitator to Resource server: Return isValid false (nonce already used). Step 6: Resource server to Client (agent): 402 with a fresh PAYMENT-REQUIRED.
  autonumber
  participant p_client as Client (agent)
  participant p_server as Resource server
  participant p_facilitator as Facilitator
  participant p_chain as Base Sepolia
  p_client->>p_server: Retry with PAYMENT-SIGNATURE
  p_server->>p_facilitator: POST /verify
  Note over p_server,p_facilitator: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_facilitator->>p_chain: Read authorizationState(from, nonce)
  Note over p_facilitator,p_chain: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_chain-->>p_facilitator: Return true (nonce used)
  p_facilitator-->>p_server: Return isValid false (nonce already used)
  p_server-->>p_client: 402 with a fresh PAYMENT-REQUIRED
